  <p id="c-nanshi-070-duyuan-grandfather:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-070-duyuan-grandfather:p001:m0000" ref="b7k_v7g_vfe_*AB">杜慧度</persName>，交址朱鳶人也。本屬京兆。曾祖<persName id="c-nanshi-070-duyuan-grandfather:p001:m0018" ref="b7k_v7g_vfe">元</persName>爲甯浦太守，遂居交址。父<persName id="c-nanshi-070-duyuan-grandfather:p001:m0031" ref="b7k_v7g_vfe_*A">瑗</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-070-duyuan-grandfather:p001:m0033" ref="b7k_v7g_vfe_*A">道言</persName>，仕州府爲日南、九德、交址太守。</p>
